{"hw":"οἰμάω","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">οἰμάω</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">οἰμ-άω</span>, (<span class=\"lex-etym gk\">οἴμη</span>) only <span class=\"lex-gram\">fut.</span> and <span class=\"lex-gram\">aor.</span>, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">swoop</b> or <b class=\"lex-tr\">pounce upon,</b> <span class=\"gk\">οἴμησεν δὲ ἀλεὶς ὥς τ' αἰετός</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Il.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">22.308</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">311</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">κίρκος.. οἴμησε μετὰ τρήρωνα πέλειαν</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">swooped</b> after a dove, ib.<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">140</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">2</span> abs., <b class=\"lex-tr\">dart along,</b> <span class=\"gk\">θύννοι δ' οἰμήσουσι</span> Orac. ap. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.62</span> </span>.</div></div>"}